<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-08T06:24:33.304Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:24:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked Atiku Abubakar’s convoy, killing one suspect, while vigilantes stopped a terrorist raid on a Kwara community. Terrorists abducted 68 people and killed 32 in a Kaduna local government area, and thugs assaulted NDC supporters at a rally in Delta, also killing a 50‑year-old man whose body was burnt in a Nasarawa dry well. Troops rescued three abducted women in Plateau and cleared insurgent hideouts in Borno, and the military retrieved a cockpit voice recorder from a crashed plane that killed 25. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOMUo1Z2VpMkpzZGNCYm5hb0VRNUxPdVZrN1I4ZzB1MUt5bURPN3lXVE0zOWJfWnQ4bFI1UlpkakxDYlhJaG9oUjZBblNvbFNRaHUxX2pFRkFsMUQ4NHNpQnBVa0U1Y1VEaWNiQm9JeXpsS2U5QkdBYm9aVWo4Yjl5OU5YTUlxOTFHSVhiVWpzdHNsdk5Vd3JtaHNNd2w5UTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1kMmc2czJ5WXYwUTZRZjVEN3duTnV6UUo5a2FSN1FwZEhiU1UzMS1XeERLX1FwOF9VNk02QWE1eXpaSW5kc1hmelM5LVZqWDRxeUFKUzZ3cUNZSnhGUFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQcEtsRUZhQ0hMU0NkbC1sZXNBY3lYUFhXSzM2d1B3UllOaHNkUGJPSUE1QnB5Vmc1by12WklSYk5aN2t0NjZiTnhjUWFKb0RzUnR3NUlSVmk1cGIwWFhJd1Y4ME96UUR1UnM3UDlmYms2X0laV0E0ZlNTcUt3bndEOVpRTURwMjFGTElRc2VaRTUwUU5XQmdVejFYaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOam1zbDE2MFpMb1hTNG9fUnZfbzR0WmxJclAyaWVLT1JmQnVnazJ0Y0xGRDY1NHc3cE5KYWMxMnh5LU1WZ1JXR09sM3BGd2Q2Ri1SWFJaTmYxU1IyZjBnYjVONDdEUjN2bFB4M0ZuVWd4S1Y4WlpzMGpSY0ExZkZpVWNoeVo0ZzVVMm5sMUpnQ2x4ZjMzc0NZU08xcmp3RUlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pulse Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95c